# Design OS

Follow [`docs/aileena-design-os.md`](docs/aileena-design-os.md) on every aileena.xyz task.

```txt
follow /docs/aileena-design-os.md. no screenshots = not done. no owner approval = no merge.
```

This is a personal machine, not a portfolio. Visual-first. Less text. Real interaction only. Proof over claims. Quiet owner mode. Public softness.

Do not put `OWNER KEY` or “Visitors cannot…” in public page flow.  
Do not fake knobs, exports, comments, or status lights.  
Do not merge without screenshots + owner approval.  
Do not restore rejected home experiments (ascii / moodboard / serials / zine) — see `landing-experiment-gate.mdc`.  
